## Executive Summary

Nemotron 3.5 Super VL is NVIDIA's latest frontier model from their Nemotron series, focused on vision and multimodal understanding tasks. The "Super VL" designation indicates it's a super-variant with enhanced vision language capabilities, optimized for image understanding, visual reasoning, and multimodal applications. As part of the Nemotron 3.5 family, this model represents NVIDIA's advancement in AI for vision and multimodal tasks, competing with vision models from Western companies like Google (Gemini), OpenAI (GPT-5.5), and Anthropic.

